      "description": {
        "en": "Apple AirPods Pro 3 (MFHP4LL/A) are third-generation wireless in-ear earbuds designed for listeners who want active noise cancellation, spatial audio and convenient everyday use. They suit commuting, office work, music and workouts, while the compact in-ear design helps reduce distractions in noisy surroundings. However, this particular listing identifies the product as renewed, so buyers should not assume it has the same condition as a new retail unit.\n\nApple's official specifications state up to eight hours of listening on a single charge with Active Noise Cancellation enabled on a new unit. The earbuds also include heart-rate sensing for workouts, hearing-related features and Live Translation. Some functions depend on a compatible Apple device, current software, Apple Intelligence and supported languages or regions. Actual battery life on a renewed pair may vary with the condition of its battery.\n\nAt the supplied listing price of $199, this model may appeal to Apple users who want advanced audio features without paying the product's original $249 launch price. That comparison is historical, not confirmation of today's new-product price. Buyers who prioritize a longer warranty or a known battery condition may prefer a new pair. Confirm the seller, the 90-day limited warranty and the included accessories before purchasing, since marketing images do not establish the physical condition of a renewed unit.",
