      "description": {
        "en": "The Cosori Pro LE is a 5-quart air fryer rated at 1500 watts. Its roughly 4.7-liter capacity suits everyday portions of chicken, vegetables, fries, and meat, making it a practical option for households that want crisp textures without relying on traditional deep frying. The touch-control panel and preset cooking options make routine preparation accessible to beginners, while the dark-gray finish gives the appliance a restrained, modern appearance on the kitchen counter.\n\nThe temperature reaches up to 450°F, or approximately 232°C, giving the unit flexibility for browning and crisping a variety of foods. Its ceramic-coated nonstick basket and crisper tray are designed to help food release more easily and simplify cleanup; the listing states that these removable components are dishwasher-safe. A 30-recipe booklet is included, with additional recipes available through the VeSync app. Actual cooking times still vary with food thickness, basket loading, and recipe, so advertised quick-cooking examples should not be treated as universal results.\n\nThis model is a sensible choice for everyday meals for roughly two to four people, especially when easy cleanup and reduced oil use matter. Larger households may prefer a higher-capacity or dual-basket model to avoid cooking in batches. Buyers outside the United States should also verify electrical compatibility before ordering: this version is rated for 120V/60Hz, and a simple plug adapter does not change supply voltage.",
