        "en": "Garmin Instinct 3 AMOLED (45 mm, black) is a rugged GPS multisport watch for hikers, runners and cyclists. Its bright 1.2-inch AMOLED screen improves at-a-glance readability, while the built-in LED flashlight helps around camp or on dark paths. It weighs 53 g.\n\nThe build combines a fiber-reinforced polymer case, metal-reinforced bezel, chemically strengthened glass lens and silicone strap. Its 10 ATM water rating, multi-band GPS with SatIQ, compass and barometric altimeter suit outdoor use; heart-rate, sleep and Pulse Ox readings are estimates, not medical measurements. Garmin rates battery life at up to 18 days with gesture wake, or seven days with the display always on; GPS use reduces that figure.\n\nAt $342.99, it suits buyers who prioritize durability, training data and outdoor navigation over a slim everyday look. Smart notifications require a compatible paired phone. Those who need detailed offline maps or the longest possible always-on battery may prefer a different model or the Instinct 3 Solar.",
