      "description": {
        "en": "The Ollygrin BG702S-PG is an electric burr grinder with 40 mm stainless-steel conical burrs and 30 settings. It lets home users adjust grounds from fine for espresso to coarser French-press ranges, offering more control than a blade grinder. Its compact footprint and rotary dial suit everyday home brewing.\n\nGrinding quantity is selectable for 2–12 cups. The hopper has an auto-closing gate to reduce spills when detached; the grounds container and upper burr are removable, and a cleaning brush is included. Ollygrin cites a gear-reduction motor to limit frictional heat, a friction clutch, and overheating protection. But dimensions conflict: text says a 10-ounce hopper and 12-inch height, while images say 300 g/10.6 ounces and 12.9 inches.\n\nConsider it for home users who want one simple grinder for several brew styles. Espresso enthusiasts needing documented fine-grind consistency should compare specialist models. International buyers should verify voltage, plug, warranty, and included accessories. Amazon currently displays no featured offer, so value cannot be judged without a live price.",
